OL,3,GNEWSAIsolation of stroke tackled in
OL,4,Acharity support group
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe and Bridget now both attend Stroke
OL,7,FAssociation Guernsey's communications
OL,8,Fclub, a group which helps rebuild key
OL,9,Fcommunication skills and enable people
OL,10,Faffected to connect with others,
OL,11,Fsomething which Andrew said had given
OL,12,Fhim and his wife a "stepping stone back
OL,13,Finto the future".
